      "summaries": {
        "en": "SWC is a Rust-based platform for compiling and bundling JavaScript and TypeScript, designed to replace Babel and Terser with much higher speed. Its core strength lies in leveraging Rust's performance and parallelism to achieve 20x faster single-threaded and 70x faster multi-threaded transformations. You can use it as a drop-in replacement for Babel in your build pipeline or as a standalone parser, minifier, and bundler for web projects.",
        "zh": "SWC是一个基于Rust的JavaScript和TypeScript编译与打包平台，旨在替代Babel和Terser，提供极致的编译速度。其核心优势在于利用Rust的高性能和并行处理能力，单线程转换速度比Babel快20倍，多线程快70倍。技术上，SWC通过Rust实现高效的AST操作和增量编译，支持最新的ECMAScript和TypeScript语法。你可以将其作为Babel的直接替代品集成到Webpack、Vite等构建工具中，或独立使用其解析器、压缩器和打包器。对于追求构建性能的前端项目，SWC能显著缩短开发迭代时间，尤其适合大型代码库和CI/CD环境。",
        "es": "SWC is a Rust-based platform for compiling and bundling JavaScript and TypeScript, designed to replace Babel and Terser with much higher speed. Its core strength lies in leveraging Rust's performance and parallelism to achieve 20x faster single-threaded and 70x faster multi-threaded transformations. You can use it as a drop-in replacement for Babel in your build pipeline or as a standalone parser, minifier, and bundler for web projects.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "swc stands out for babel, compiler, and ecmascript in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "SWC is a Rust-based platform for compiling and bundling JavaScript and TypeScript, designed to replace Babel and Terser with much higher speed. Its core strength lies in leveraging Rust's performance and parallelism to achieve 20x faster single-threaded and 70x faster multi-threaded transformations. You can use it as a drop-in replacement for Babel in your build pipeline or as a standalone parser, minifier, and bundler for web projects.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/swc-project/swc for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
