      "summaries": {
        "en": "aisuite is a Python library that provides a simple, unified interface to multiple generative AI providers, solving the problem of vendor lock-in and API fragmentation. Its key technical insight is a consistent API abstraction that lets you switch between providers like OpenAI, Anthropic, and Google with a single line change. Practically, you can use it to build multi-provider applications, compare model outputs, or create fallback chains for reliability.",
        "zh": "aisuite是一个Python库，通过统一的接口简化了对多个生成式AI提供商的调用，解决了供应商锁定和API碎片化的问题。其核心技术亮点是提供一致的API抽象层，让你只需更改一行代码就能在OpenAI、Anthropic、Google等提供商之间切换。实际应用中，你可以用它构建多提供商应用、对比不同模型的输出结果，或者创建故障转移链以提高可靠性。无论是快速原型开发还是生产系统，aisuite都能让你灵活地利用各家AI能力，避免被单一供应商束缚。",
        "es": "aisuite is a Python library that provides a simple, unified interface to multiple generative AI providers, solving the problem of vendor lock-in and API fragmentation. Its key technical insight is a consistent API abstraction that lets you switch between providers like OpenAI, Anthropic, and Google with a single line change. Practically, you can use it to build multi-provider applications, compare model outputs, or create fallback chains for reliability.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "aisuite gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "aisuite is a Python library that provides a simple, unified interface to multiple generative AI providers, solving the problem of vendor lock-in and API fragmentation. Its key technical insight is a consistent API abstraction that lets you switch between providers like OpenAI, Anthropic, and Google with a single line change. Practically, you can use it to build multi-provider applications, compare model outputs, or create fallback chains for reliability.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/andrewyng/aisuite for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
